		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Floating, white-shelled, 5 foot wide crab. Drooping, barbed tendrils. Space vermin that drift onto a planet and eat flesh, wood, organic material.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 pincer +4 (1d8 + grab), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Implant</strong>. Lay eggs inside grabbed or helpless mortal. CON 15+ or 1d4 CON damage (cannot heal while ill). Repeat check once per hour; ends on success. Die at 0 CON, spawning 2d6 lunarma larvae from the corpse.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
